  "description": "<p data-start=\"46\" data-end=\"135\"><strong data-start=\"46\" data-end=\"135\">Stijlvolle, handgetekende run-and-gun game met uitdagende bossfights – In Nette Staat</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"137\" data-end=\"482\"><em data-start=\"137\" data-end=\"146\">Cuphead</em> staat bekend om zijn unieke 1930’s-cartoonstijl, volledig handgetekende animaties en krachtige jazz-soundtrack. De game combineert platformactie met pittige bossfights die precisie, timing en doorzettingsvermogen vereisen. Het resultaat is een uitdagende maar enorm bevredigende ervaring voor spelers die van klassieke gameplay houden.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"575\">Dit exemplaar betreft een <strong data-start=\"510\" data-end=\"529\">losse cartridge</strong> (geen doosje) en verkeert <strong data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"574\">In Nette Staat</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"615\"><strong data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"615\">Waarom Cuphead een unieke titel is</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"890\">\r\n<li data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"681\">\r\n<p data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"681\">🎨 Handgetekende artstyle geïnspireerd op jaren ’30 animatie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"734\">\r\n<p data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"734\">🔥 Uitdagende bossfights en run-and-gun gameplay</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"775\">\r\n<p data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"775\">🎼 Jazzy soundtrack voor extra sfeer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"828\">\r\n<p data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"828\">🎮 Perfect voor spelers die houden van uitdaging</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"869\">\r\n<p data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"869\">🧱 <strong data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"853\">Losse cartridge</strong> (geen doosje)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"890\">\r\n<p data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"890\">✨ In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"895\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"921\">📋 <strong data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"921\">Specificaties</strong></h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"1157\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"947\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"947\">\r\n<th data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"936\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eigenschap</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"947\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1157\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1016\">\r\n<td data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"985\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Soort game</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1016\">Run-and-gun actieplatformer</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1047\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1028\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Platform</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1047\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Nintendo Switch</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1092\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1061\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Speelmodus</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1092\">Singleplayer & lokale co-op</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1130\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1107\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Meegeleverd</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1130\"><strong data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1128\">Losse cartridge</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1157\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1139\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Staat</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1157\" data-col-size=\"sm\">In Nette Staat</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1162\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1200\" data-is-last-node=\